  {
    "statement": "Two replicated, controlled studies from Norway found lowered levels of feeding efficiency in salmon fed plant-based protein diets compared to fish meal diets.",
    "citations": []
  },
  {
    "statement": "A replicated study in Norway found increased levels of feeding efficiency in salmon fed plant-based protein diets compared to fish meal diets.",
    "citations": []
  },
  {
    "statement": "Two replicated, controlled studies found that the digestibility of feed components by salmon was lower when the diets contained plant proteins compared to fish meal.",
    "citations": []
  },
  {
    "statement": "Two randomised, replicated, controlled studies in Scotland and Norway found similar levels of digestibility between plant-based protein diets and fish meal-based diets.",
